<title>INDIA: Yield at India 91-day t-bill eases to 8.14 percent.</title>
<headline>Yield at India 91-day t-bill eases to 8.14 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it set a cut-off price of 98.01 rupees at the weekly 91-day treasury bills auction on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield worked out to 8.14 percent, down from 8.19 percent at last week's auction.  </p>
